  "abstract": "This experiment tests the generalization of the learnable gamma ramp (previously shown to improve Fourier Forecaster SOTA) to a 'Minimal Factorized MLP' backbone (Episteme I's ID 226). This MLP model is a bare-bones factorized architecture without residual heads, LayerNorm, or curvature loss. We apply the learnable gamma (initialized as a linear ramp) to its output. This study is crucial for a complete publication, demonstrating whether the gamma ramp is universally beneficial or architecture-specific.",
